     5	//! `createResult`/`mayPickup`/`onTake` there (line ranges cited on each function below).
     6	//!
     7	//! Two upstream mechanisms have no Pumpkin-side representation and are approximated, matching
     8	//! the precedent already established in `grindstone_screen_handler.rs`:
     9	//! - `RepairCostImpl` (`pumpkin-data`) carries no value, so the "prior work penalty" that vanilla
