     3	// Deliberate scope reduction: vanilla keys suspects by `Entity` (identity/liveness checked
     4	// live against the level) and additionally persists an `angerByUuid` side-map for suspects
     5	// that have unloaded, converting them back via `level.getEntity(uuid)` once they reload
