   137	    /// Vanilla `CarvedPumpkinBlock.replaceCopperBlockWithChest`
   138	    /// (CarvedPumpkinBlock.java:216-222) plus `CopperChestBlock.getFromCopperBlock`
   139	    /// (CopperChestBlock.java:129-134): turns the built copper block into its matching
   140	    /// copper chest, facing away from the head spot, with the double-chest type resolved
